-- Migration 0069: Document the 128-bit resource ID format (#664).
--
-- Persistent resource IDs are now 32-character lowercase hex strings
-- (128 bits) generated by chv_common::gen_resource_id(). Migration 0011
-- recorded the earlier 8-character (32-bit) format; it is kept as history.
--
-- Existing 8-character IDs remain valid: ID columns are TEXT and every
-- consumer treats IDs as opaque strings bounded at 32 bytes.
--
-- Formats that are deliberately NOT resource IDs and remain 8 characters:
--   - node certificate serials (CHV_CERTIFICATE_SERIAL_HEX_LEN = 8)
--   - the two 8-character components of monitoring certificate serials
